d.DataFrame({s: np.bincount(v, minlength=K) / len(v) for s, v in\n","                          [('train', y_tr), ('val', y_va), ('test', y_te)]}, index=CLASSES)\n","split_tab"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"9e1423fe","metadata":{"id":"9e1423fe"},"source":["## Task 1 — Problem Structure and Data Representation (4 marks)\n","\n","**Learning-task decomposition (Mitchell's T, P, E)**\n","\n","| Component | AgriVision | How it constrains the solution |\n","|---|---|---|\n","| Task **T** | Multi-class classification $f:\\mathbb{R}^{4096}\\to\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$ | Needs a probabilistic output over $K$ classes → softmax / cross-entropy (Task 3, 8) |\n","| Input **x** | 64×64 grayscale leaf photo, $x\\in[0,1]^{4096}$ | High-dimensional, spatially correlated → redundancy (Task 2), curse of dimensionality (Task 11) |\n","| Output **y** | Class label $y\\in\\{0..K-1\\}$, one-hot $\\mathbf{e}_y\\in\\{0,1\\}^K$ | Imbalanced classes → accuracy alone misleading |\n","| Performance **P** | Accuracy + macro precision/recall/F1 + confusion matrix | Macro-F1 weights rare diseases equally; recall matters (a missed disease spreads) |\n","| Experience **E** | Labelled PlantVillage images | Lab images, uniform background → optimistic vs field photos |\n","\n","**Tensor organisation**\n","\n","| Object | Type | Shape | Why the shape matters |\n","|---|---|---|---|\n","| one label $y_i$ | scalar | () | integer class index; one-hot vector $(K,)$ for cross-entropy |\n","| one image | matrix → vector | (64,64) → (4096,) | flattening discards 2-D neighbourhood |\n","| mini-batch | matrix / 4-D tensor | (32,4096) or (32,64,64,1) | rows = samples, enables $XW$ in one matmul |\n","| dataset | design matrix | (N,4096) | $X^\\top X$ is 4096×4096 → PCA cost |\n","| labels | vector / matrix | (N,) or (N,K) | $P-Y$ appears in the gradient (Task 8) |\n","\n","**Norms** (for $x\\in\\mathbb{R}^n$): $\\;\\|x\\|_1=\\sum_i|x_i|,\\quad \\|x\\|_2=\\sqrt{\\sum_i x_i^2},\\quad \\|x\\|_\\infty=\\max_i|x_i|$"]},{"cel