  {\n      \"column\": \"H(p_val)\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"dtype\": \"number\",\n        \"std\": 0.0,\n        \"min\": 3.0298,\n        \"max\": 3.0298,\n        \"num_unique_values\": 1,\n        \"samples\": [\n          3.0298\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"column\": \"H(p, q\\u0304)\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"dtype\": \"number\",\n        \"std\": 0.09145233731294138,\n        \"min\": 3.0312,\n        \"max\": 3.1897,\n        \"num_unique_values\": 3,\n        \"samples\": [\n          3.0314\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"column\": \"KL(p||q\\u0304)\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"dtype\": \"number\",\n        \"std\": 0.09145233731294132,\n        \"min\": 0.0014,\n        \"max\": 0.1599,\n        \"num_unique_values\": 3,\n        \"samples\": [\n          0.0016\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"column\": \"KL(q\\u0304||p)\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"dtype\": \"number\",\n        \"std\": 0.08212821277328111,\n        \"min\": 0.0014,\n        \"max\": 0.1438,\n        \"num_unique_values\": 3,\n        \"samples\": [\n          0.0017\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"column\": \"mean pred. entropy\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"dtype\": \"number\",\n        \"std\": 0.9280954207407771,\n        \"min\": 0.942,\n        \"max\": 2.7957,\n        \"num_unique_values\": 3,\n        \"samples\": [\n          1.7856\n        ],\n        \"semantic_type\": \"\",\n        \"description\": \"\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"}},"metadata":{}},{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["check H(p,q̄) = H(p) + KL(p||q̄): True\n"]}],"source":["models_pca, rows = make_models(), []\n","for name, m in models_pca.items():\n","    m.fit(Z_tr, y_tr); Pq = m.predict_proba(Z_va)\n","    ce_img = np.mean(-np.log2(np.clip(Pq[np.arange(len(y_va)), y_va], 1e-12, 1)))\n","    p_va = np.bincount(y_va, minlength=K) / len(y_va); q_bar = Pq.mean(0)\n","    rows.append([name, f4(accuracy_score(y_va, Pq.argmax(1))), f4(ce_img), f4((Pq.max(1) < 1e-12).mean()),\n","                 f4(np.mean(Pq[np.arange(len(y_va)), y_va] == 0)), f4(H(p_va)), f4(CE(p_va, q_bar)),\n","                 f4(KL(p_va, q_bar)), f4(KL(q_bar, p_va)), f4(np.mean([H(r) for r in Pq]))])\n","info = pd.DataFrame(rows, columns=['model', 'val acc', 'per-image CE = KL (bits)', '_', 'frac q_y = 0',\n","                                   'H(p_val)', 'H(p, q̄)', 'KL(p||q̄)', 'KL(q̄||p)', 'mean pred. entropy']).drop(columns='_')\n","display(info)\n","print('check H(p,q̄) = H(p) + KL(p||q̄):', np.allclose(info['H(p, q̄)'], info['H(p_val)'] + info['KL(p||q̄)'], atol=1e-3))"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"0cc1c9d3","metadata":{"id":"0cc1c9d3"},"source":["### KL asymmetry with my own numbers\n","$p=[0.5,0.3,0.2]$ (true), $q=[0.8,0.15,0.05]$ (over-confident model)\n","\n","$D_{KL}(p\\|q)=0.5\\log_2\\frac{0.5}{0.8}+0.3\\log_2\\frac{0.3}{0.15}+0.2\\log_2\\frac{0.2}{0.05}=-0.3390+0.3000+0.4000=\\mathbf{0.3610}$ bits\n","\n","$D_{KL}(q\\|p)=0.8\\log_2\\frac{0.8}{0.5}+0.15\\log_2\\frac{0.15}{0.3}+0.05\\log_2\\frac{0.05}{0.2}=0.5425-0.1500-0.1000=\\mathbf{0.2925}$ bits\n","\n","* $D_{KL}(p\\|q)$ weights by the **truth**: it punishes the model for giving low probability where real cases occur (the rare class 3 dominates: 0.4 bits) → \"mass-covering\", what training with cross-entropy minimises.\n","* $D_{KL}(q\\|p)$ weights by the **model**: it punishes confident predictions in places the truth doesn't support → \"mode-seeking\"."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"fec0897f","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-12T04:16:15.753454Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-12T04:16:15.753114Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-12T04:16:15.760456Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-12T04:16:15.758925Z"},"id":"fec0897f","outputId":"0b528d60-de16-4e01-d308-802ea9c8a0c0","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791961214923,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":41,"user":{"displayName":"Padmanabhan S","userId":"00156433950367292426"}}},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["KL(p||q) = 0.361 | KL(q||p) = 0.2925\n"]}],"source":["p3, q3 = np.array([0.5, 0.3, 0.2]), np.array([0.8, 0.15, 0.05])\n","print('KL(p||q) =', f4(KL(p3, q3)), '| KL(q||p) =', f4(KL(q3, p3)))"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"f974ef82","metadata":{"id":"f974ef82"},"source":["**Why minimising CE ≡ minimising KL:** $H(p,q_\\theta)=H(p)+D_{KL}(p\\|q_\\theta)$ and $H(p)$ does not depend on $\\theta$, so $\\nabla_\\theta H(p,q_\\theta)=\\nabla_\\theta D_{KL}(p\\|q_\\theta)$ and both have the same minimiser.\n","\n","**Points to analyse:** k-NN gives hard 0/1-ish probabilities → some $q_y=0$ → huge CE (over-confident errors); LR is calibrated-ish → lower CE even if accuracy is similar; RF averages trees → soft probabilities, high predictive entropy."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"9399fd38","metadata":{"id":"9399fd38"},"source":["## Task 4 — Numerical Computation Issues (3 marks)\n","\n","**Softmax:** $\\text{softmax}(z)_i=\\dfrac{e^{z_i}}{\\sum_j e^{z_j}}$. **Stable form:** with $m=\\max_j z_j$,\n","$\\text{softmax}(z)_i=\\dfrac{e^{z_i-m}}{\\sum_j e^{z_j-m}}$ (multiply numerator and denominator by $e^{-m}$ → identical value).\n","**Log-sum-exp:** $\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j}=m+\\log\\sum_j e^{z_j-m}$, so $\\log\\text{softmax}(z)_i=z_i-m-\\log\\sum_je^{z_j-m}$.\n","\n","Hand check for $z=[1000,999,995]$: $z-m=[0,-1,-5]$, $e^{z-m}=[1,\\,0.3679,\\,0.0067]$, sum $=1.3746$ →\n","softmax $=[0.7275,\\ 0.2676,\\ 0.0049]$. Naively $e^{1000}$ exceeds float64's max ($\\approx e^{709.78}$) → `inf/inf = nan`."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"65374ace","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-12T04:16:15.764319Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-12T04:16:15.763957Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-12T04:16:15.777373Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-12T04:16:15.775882Z"},"id":"65374ace","outputId":"d2ea2ed3-3b20-4b7c-8018-272113e139d9","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791961215058,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":132,"user":{"displayName":"Padmanabhan S","userId":"00156433950367292426"}}},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["z=[1000.  999.  995.]: naive=[nan nan nan] | stable=[0.7275 0.2676 0.0049] | log-softmax=[-0.3182 -1.3182 -5.3182]\n","z=[-1000.  -999.  -995.]: naive=[nan nan nan] | stable=[0.0066 0.0179 0.9756] | log-softmax=[-5.0247 -4.0247 -0.0247]\n","z=[ 3.  2. -2.]: naive=[0.7275 0.2676 0.0049] | stable=[0.7275 0.2676 0.0049] | log-softmax=[-0.3182 -1.3182 -5.3182]\n","float32 overflow threshold: exp(88.8) = inf | float64: exp(709.8) = inf\n","naive == stable for moderate z: True\n"]}],"source":["def softmax_naive(z): e = np.exp(z); return e / e.sum()\n","def softmax_stable(z): e = np.exp(z - np.max(z)); return e / e.sum()\n","def log_softmax(z): m = np.max(z); return z - m - np.log(np.exp(z - m).sum())\n","\n","with np.errstate(all='ignore'):\n","    for z in [np.array([1000., 999, 995]), np.array([-1000., -999, -995]), np.array([3., 2, -2])]:\n","        print(f'z={z}: naive={softmax_naive(z)} | stable={softmax_stable(z).round(4)} | log-softmax={log_softmax(z).round(4)}')\n","    print('float32 overflow threshold: exp(88.8) =', np.exp(np.float32(88.8)), '| float64: exp(709.8) =', np.exp(709.8))\n","    z = np.array([3., 2, -2]); print('naive == stable for moderate z:', np.allclose(softmax_naive(z), softmax_stable(z)))"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"3da15d1f","metadata":{"id":"3da15d1f"},"source":["### Condition Number of the Feature Covariance\n","**Condition number**\n","$$\\kappa(C)=\\frac{\\lambda_{\\max}}{\\lambda_{\\min}}$$\n","**GD contraction per step** (quadratic loss, best fixed step)\n","$$\\|w_t-w^*\\|\\le\\left(\\frac{\\kappa-1}{\\kappa+1}\\right)^t\\|w_0-w^*\\|$$"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"2aa2dba8","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-12T04:16:15.780602Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-12T04:16:15.780236Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-12T04:16:16.244893Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-12T04:16:16.244351Z"},"id":"2aa2dba8","outputId":"a6346967-43da-444f-c8c5-971556df1764","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":195},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791961215098,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":37,"user":{"displayName":"Padmanabhan S","userId":"00156433950367292426"}}},"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["                          features  lambda_max  lambda_min (non-zero)  \\\n","0             raw pixels (centred)     16.7740                 0.0000   \n","1                   PCA-560 scores     16.7740                 0.0070   \n","2  PCA-560 standardised (whitened)      1.0281                 0.9899   \n","\n","   condition number κ  GD contraction (κ-1)/(κ+1)  \n","0         687124.1120                      1.0000  \n","1           2396.2857                      0.9992  \n","2              1.0386                      0.0189  "],"text/html":["\n","  <div id=\"df-5bd5fdc5-8a2c-4258-ba21-549168216449\" class=\"colab-df-container\">\n","    <div>\n","<style scoped>\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n","        vertical-align: middle;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n","        vertical-align: top;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe thead th {\n","        text-align: right;\n","    }\n","</style>\n","<table border=\"1\" class=\"dataframe\">\n","  <thead>\n","    <tr style=\"text-align: right;\">\n","      <th></th>\n","      <th>features</th>\n","      <th>lambda_max</th>\n","      <th>lambda_min (non-zero)</th>\n","      <th>condition number κ</th>\n","      <th>GD contracti