itened =', f4(kap_raw), '-> predicted contraction', f4((kap_raw - 1) / (kap_raw + 1)),\n","      '| κ whitened =', f4(kap_w), '-> predicted', f4((kap_w - 1) / (kap_w + 1)))\n","display(lr_tab[lr_tab['η / η_crit'] == 0.5])\n","print('Bias-variance (Task 7) vs capacity curve (Task 6):'); display(bvt[['bias²', 'variance', '0-1 error']])"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"63299fc1","metadata":{"id":"63299fc1"},"source":["**Points to analyse:** (1) accuracy retained usually exceeds EVR at small k – PCA keeps the high-variance (discriminative) directions and drops pixel noise;\n","the curve is *not* the identity because variance ≠ class information. (2) Whitening should converge faster, as κ predicts; the GD bound is only\n","approximate because softmax-CE is not quadratic (curvature shrinks as $p$ becomes confident). (3) Depth-2 tree = high bias ↔ left side of Task 6 curves;\n","depth-∞ = high variance ↔ large generalisation gap. Explain any disagreement (finite samples, non-quadratic loss, 0-1 vs Brier loss)."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"a29ff588","metadata":{"id":"a29ff588"},"source":["## Task 11 — Is Deep Learning Justified? (4 marks)\n","\n","Evidence measured below: (a) curse of dimensionality – **distance concentration** $\\frac{d_{max}-d_{min}}{d_{min}}$;\n","(b) **local constancy** – does a tiny, label-preserving change (shifting the leaf by a few pixels) keep the image close in pixel space?;\n","(c) **manifold structure** – intrinsic dimension by the TwoNN estimator $\\hat d = n/\\sum_i\\log(r_2^{(i)}/r_1^{(i)})$."]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":null,"id":"b931396f","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-12T04:30:46.718164Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-12T04:30:46.717893Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-12T04:30:47.472021Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-12T04:30:47.470871Z"},"id":"b931396f","outputId":"ae092efa-87ab-4f1e-ee6f-0c8eae3f8c84","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1791962471963,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":328,"user":{"displayName":"Padmanabhan S","userId":"00156433950367292426"}}},"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["distance contrast (dmax-dmin)/dmin – raw 4096 : 3.4196999073028564\n","distance contrast – PCA-560            : 3.7441000938415527\n","fraction where the 3-px shifted SAME leaf is farther than the nearest DIFFERENT-class image: 0.335\n","TwoNN intrinsic dimension (1500 images): 29.1299991607666 | ambient = 4096 | k95 = 560\n"]}],"source":["def concentration(A, Bm):\n","    D = euclidean_distances(A, Bm); return f4(np.mean((D.max(1) - D.min(1)) / D.min(1)))\n","nq = 200\n","print('distance contrast (dmax-dmin)/dmin – raw 4096 :', concentration(X_va[:nq], X_tr[:2000]))\n","print(f'distance contrast – PCA-{K_PCA}            :', concentration(Z_va[:nq], Z_tr[:2000]))\n","\n","# Local constancy: distance to a 3-pixel shifted copy vs distance to the nearest image of ANOTHER class\n","idx_q = rng.permutation(len(X_img))[:nq]\n","shift = np.roll(X_img[idx_q], 3, axis=2).reshape(nq, -1)\n","orig = X_img[idx_q].reshape(nq, -1)\n","d_shift = np.linalg.norm(orig - shift, axis=1)\n","D_all = euclidean_distances(orig, X_tr[:3000])\n","other = y_tr[:3000][None, :] != y[idx_q][:, None]\n","d_other = np.where(other, D_all, np.inf).min(1)\n","print('fraction where the 3-px shifted SAME leaf is farther than the nearest DIFFERENT-class image:', f4((d_shift > d_other).mean()))\n","\n","def twonn(A):\n","    D = euclidean_distances(A); np.fill_diagonal(D, np.inf); D.sort(1)\n","    mu = D[:, 1] / np.maximum(D[:, 0], 1e-12); mu = mu[mu > 1]; return f4(len(mu) / np.log(mu).sum())\n","print('TwoNN intrinsic dimension (1500 images):', twonn(X_tr[:1500]), '| ambient = 4096 | k95 =', K_PCA)"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"7464cf3f","metadata":{"id":"7464cf3f"},"source":["### Reference: Small CNN (learned hierarchical features)\n","**Convolution** (shared local filter, translation-equivariant)\n","$$h_{ij}=\\sigma\\Big(\\sum_{